        <!--
        Default vcloud project version. The attribute ${vcloud.project.version} is
        locally scoped such that if a project defines a version it will override
        what is defined in the parent.  Using ${vcloud.project.version} within the
        artifact version dependency definition thus may have an unintentional
        side-effect of not using the right artifact version if project is not
        using the default project version.  Currently many projects within the
        QE test source have a reference to this top level POM file and have
        non-default project versions.
        -->
        <vcloud.project.version>1.0.0</vcloud.project.version>

